WEBVTT

00:00:00.115 --> 00:00:06.354
Tracking overdue books

00:00:06.404 --> 00:00:08.778
Open Library and Overdue.

00:00:16.404 --> 00:00:22.708
The tiles show how many books are overdue, the fines built up so far, and the fine per day.

00:00:23.575 --> 00:00:31.183
Each row shows the borrower, the due date, the days overdue and the fine. The oldest loans are first.

00:00:33.487 --> 00:00:39.960
Press Return on a row and confirm. The fine is recorded and the loan leaves the overdue list.

00:00:44.702 --> 00:00:49.384
Overdue under control
